{"strongs": "H0425", "word": "אֵלָה", "translit": "e.lah", "root": "אול", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "terebinth", "definition": "II. אֵלָה proper name, masculine ( terebinth , compare Gen 49:21 below I. אֵלָה ) 1. a chief of Edom Gen 36:41 = 1Chr 1:52 (= אֵילַת proper name, of a location ? see Di ). 2. son of Baasha; reigned two years in Israel 1Kgs 16:6 ; 1Kgs 16:8 ; 1Kgs 16:13 ; 1Kgs 16:14 . 3. father of Hoshea who was last king of Isr. 2Kgs 15:30 ; 2Kgs 17:1 ; 2Kgs 18:1 ; 2Kgs 18:9 . 4. a son of Caleb 1Chr 4:15 (twice in verse). 5. a son of Uzzi 1Chr 9:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB208')\">BDB208</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H425')\">H425</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB207')\">BDB207</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB209')\">BDB209</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>אֵלָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>terebinth</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Gen 49:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,21)\">Gen 49:21</ref> below I. <bdbheb>אֵלָה</bdbheb>) <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a chief of Edom <ref ref=\"Gen 36:41\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,41)\">Gen 36:41</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:52\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,52)\">1Chr 1:52</ref> (= <bdbheb>אֵילַת</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> ? see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> son of Baasha; reigned two years in Israel <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,6)\">1Kgs 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,8)\">1Kgs 16:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,13)\">1Kgs 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,14)\">1Kgs 16:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> father of Hoshea who was last king of Isr. <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,30)\">2Kgs 15:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,1)\">2Kgs 17:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,1)\">2Kgs 18:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,9)\">2Kgs 18:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> a son of Caleb <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,15)\">1Chr 4:15</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> a son of Uzzi <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,8)\">1Chr 9:8</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 49:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Gen 36:41", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 36, "verse": 41}, {"raw": "1Chr 1:52", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 1, "verse": 52}, {"raw": "1Kgs 16:6", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Kgs 16:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "1Kgs 16:13", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Kgs 16:14", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 16, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "2Kgs 15:30", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "2Kgs 17:1", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 17, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "2Kgs 18:1", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "2Kgs 18:9", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Chr 4:15", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:8", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 8}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֵלָה", "אֵילַת"], "aramaic